# AIN’T NO PARTY LIKE A ROLLER PRAISE PARTY!’

\
Get ready to Roll, Praise and Groove all night at Roller Praise Party: 80s Retro Disco Edition on Saturday 6th June 2026 at 7:00 PM.

\
Join us as ***ROLLER PRAISE PARTY*** returns for another unforgettable evening of Faith, Fun, Music and Fellowship, this time with an extra splash of 80s Retro Flavour. \
Think vibrant colours, disco energy, feel-good vibes, flairs, afros and a night full of celebration as we skate together and give thanks for all the Lord has done.

\
This is set to be our Huge 80s Themed Praise Party, packed with amazing energy, exciting moments, competitions and more. If you’ve been before, then you already know the joy, the atmosphere and the community this event brings. If you missed out last time, this is your chance to come and experience it for yourself and this special retro edition is the perfect one to be part of.\
So bring your best 80s-inspired retro disco look, get ready to skate, dance, laugh and fellowship with fellow believers, and let’s make it a night to remember.

\
Come ready to groove to uplifting tunes, celebrate in style and enjoy a one-of-a-kind event experience that beautifully blends Faith and Fun.

## \

What to expect:

- FULL LIVE GOSPEL BAND

- SPECIAL GUEST DJs

- LIVE PERFORMANCES

- AMERICAN DINER

- MOCKTAILS

- PHOTOBOOTH

- COMPETITIONS

- +MORE

  \
